<section class="border-t border-line bg-milk py-14 sm:py-16" aria-labelledby="guide-heading"><div class="wrap"><div class="max-w-2xl"><span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-ghee-800 uppercase">Kitchen Guide</span><h2 id="guide-heading" class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">Which jar size is right for your kitchen?</h2><p class="mt-2 text-base text-ink-700">All three sizes contain the exact same single-origin buffalo ghee. Pick the size that fits your household cooking routine.</p></div><div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-line bg-cream/70 p-6 shadow-xs transition-all duration-300 hover:border-ghee-400 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold bg-milk text-ink-800 border border-line">First Try</span><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-ink-600">Lasts 2–3 weeks</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink-950">500 ml Jar</h3><div class="mt-1 flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-lg font-bold text-ink-900">₹1,350</span><span class="text-xs text-ink-600">₹2,700 / L</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Great for trying authentic buffalo ghee on morning rotis and dal. Lasts 2–3 weeks in small kitchens.</p><div class="mt-auto border-t border-line/70 pt-4 text-xs font-medium text-ink-600"><span class="font-semibold text-ink-800">Ideal for: </span>Singles, couples &amp; testing purity</div></div><div class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-line bg-cream/70 p-6 shadow-xs transition-all duration-300 hover:border-ghee-400 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold bg-pasture-800 text-cream shadow-sm">Most Popular</span><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-ink-600">Lasts 4–5 weeks</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink-950">1 L Jar</h3><div class="mt-1 flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-lg font-bold text-ink-900">₹2,210</span><span class="text-xs text-ink-600">₹2,210 / L (Save 18%)</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">The daily kitchen workhorse for daily rotis, vegetable tadka, khichdi, and children's daily nourishment.</p><div class="mt-auto border-t border-line/70 pt-4 text-xs font-medium text-ink-600"><span class="font-semibold text-ink-800">Ideal for: </span>Standard families of 3 to 5 people</div></div><div class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-line bg-cream/70 p-6 shadow-xs transition-all duration-300 hover:border-ghee-400 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold bg-ink-950 text-ghee-300 shadow-sm">Best Value</span><span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-ink-600">Lasts 2–3 months</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink-950">5 L Jar</h3><div class="mt-1 flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-lg font-bold text-ink-900">₹9,900</span><span class="text-xs text-ink-600">₹1,980 / L (Save 27%)</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Lowest price per litre across all sizes. Perfect for halwa, ladoos, festive cooking, and long-term pantry storage.</p><div class="mt-auto border-t border-line/70 pt-4 text-xs font-medium text-ink-600"><span class="font-semibold text-ink-800">Ideal for: </span>Joint families &amp; festive halwa/sweets</div></div></div></div></section>
