<section class="border-t border-line bg-pasture-950 py-12 text-cream" aria-label="Purity guarantees"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-pasture-800 text-ghee-400"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-5" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3 4.5 6v5.5c0 4.6 3.2 8.4 7.5 9.5 4.3-1.1 7.5-4.9 7.5-9.5V6L12 3Zm-3 9 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-cream sm:text-xl">100% Buffalo Fat</h3><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-pasture-200">Zero cow milk mixing. Zero vanaspati or vegetable oil. Verified RM value of 32.4.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-pasture-800 text-ghee-400"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-5" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6L4.6 18.2A1.8 1.8 0 0 0 6.2 21h11.6a1.8 1.8 0 0 0 1.6-2.8L14 9V3M7 15h10"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-cream sm:text-xl">NABL Lab Tested</h3><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-pasture-200">Every single batch is independently tested against strict FSSAI national standards.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-pasture-800 text-ghee-400"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-5" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 6h11v10H3zM14 9h4l3 3.5V16h-7M7.5 19a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Zm10 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-cream sm:text-xl">24h Dispatch</h3><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-pasture-200">Packed fresh and dispatched within 24 hours with live SMS and WhatsApp tracking.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-pasture-800 text-ghee-400"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-5" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 11a8 8 0 0 0-14.3-4.9L4 8M4 4v4h4M4 13a8 8 0 0 0 14.3 4.9L20 16m0 4v-4h-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-cream sm:text-xl">7-Day Refund</h3><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-pasture-200">If an accredited lab test shows impurity, email us the report for a 100% refund.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap py-14 sm:py-16" aria-labelledby="faq-quick-heading"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-ghee-800 uppercase">Got Questions?</span><h2 id="faq-quick-heading" class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink-950 sm:text-4xl">Everything you need before your first order</h2></div><div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl divide-y divide-line rounded-2xl border border-line bg-milk p-6 shadow-sm"><details class="group py-4 first:pt-0"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink-950 sm:text-xl"><span>Is cash on delivery free across India?</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Yes. Cash on delivery is completely free with no extra fees across all serviceable pincodes in India.</p></details><details class="group py-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink-950 sm:text-xl"><span>What is the shelf life of unopened and opened ghee?</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">Unopened, Farm Dip ghee lasts 12 months in a cool, dark cupboard. Once opened, it keeps for months provided you use a clean, dry spoon.</p></details><details class="group py-4 last:pb-0"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink-950 sm:text-xl"><span>How does the 7-day purity refund policy work?</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-700">If you believe the ghee does not meet quality or purity standards, you can have it tested at an accredited laboratory and email us the report. Upon verification, we issue a 100% refund within 7 days.</p></details></div><div class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-ink-700">Have more questions? Browse our <a class="font-semibold text-ink-950 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ghee-800" href="/pages/faq">Questions &amp; Answers page</a> or <a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-ink-950 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ghee-800">WhatsApp us directly</a>.</div></section>

